{"id":"603767","name":"芝士焗吐司","author":"吴妈厨房","authorId":"12572259","desc":"","cover":"images/603767/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"2片"},{"name":"芝士碎","amount":"1小碗"},{"name":"蔬菜粒","amount":"20g"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"10只"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1g"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"2片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/603767/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"吐司切丁，鸡蛋打成液。","img":"images/603767/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"虾仁用料酒和胡椒粉腌制一下。","img":"images/603767/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入洋葱丁和蔬菜粒，挤入沙拉酱。","img":"images/603767/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"铺上芝士碎。","img":"images/603767/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入烤箱温度180℃烤20分钟。","img":"images/603767/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出即可享用。","img":"images/603767/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香气四溢，好吃的停不下来。","img":"images/603767/step_8.jpeg"}],"tips":"每个烤箱温度控制不一样，看到表面上色差不多就盖上锡纸。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}